| description = The frost giants. Allied with the [[Kromzek]] and enemies of the [[Coldain]]. Most Kromrif are considered the lower class of the society of giants on Velious, and live either in their city of [[Kael Drakkel]] with the storm giants or venture out into the [[Eastern Wastes]] and [[Great Divide]] in search of [[Coldain]] enemies. They tend to sport rugged beards and wear leather and scale armor. Like the [[Coldain]], they have domesticated the native dire wolves of [[Velious]] to assist them in battle and track enemies and game.

Most characters will start as kill-on-sight to this faction, except [[Rallos Zek]] [[Ogre]]s.

